Personnaliser netdata
    /etc/netdata/netdata.conf
Ajouter ou modifier
"[global]
    update every = 2"
Redemarrer netdata "systemctl restart netdata"

Créer une alerte cpu
   nano /etc/netdata/health.d/cpu_usage.conf

"alarm: high_cpu_usage
on: system.cpu
lookup: average -3s percentage
every: 10s
units: %
warn: $this > 70
crit: $this > 80
info: CPU usage is high"

Redemarrer netdata "systemctl restart netdata"


